# Yeh file mein apni API key daalni hai
# IMPORTANT: Iska naam ".env" hona chahiye (yeh already .env.example hai, copy karke .env banao)
#
# Kaise use karein:
# 1. Is file ko copy karke naya file banao naam ".env" (bina .example ke)
# 2. Neeche apni actual Gemini API key paste karo
# 3. Is .env file ko kabhi GitHub pe upload mat karna (yeh secret hai)

GEMINI_API_KEY=yahan_apni_key_paste_karo
